WEBVTT

00:00:17.354 --> 00:00:20.354
A woman speaking to camera appears, seated in a bright studio with a monitor displaying a photo collage, ring light, and shelf decor behind her.

00:01:10.175 --> 00:01:13.175
She raises both hands into frame, giving two thumbs up toward the camera.

00:01:38.062 --> 00:01:41.062
A slide titled "TikTok has stated:" appears with a quoted passage, alongside an inset vertical clip labeled "TikTok CEO Shou Chew on how the TikTok algorithm actually works."

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:52.934
The slide and inset clip are replaced by a full-frame shot of the presenter seated in her office in front of a wall-mounted screen.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.610
A screenshot of TikTok's newsroom post "How TikTok recommends videos #ForYou" appears, with a sentence about the For You feed highlighted in blue.

00:02:21.977 --> 00:02:24.977
The screenshot slide is replaced by a full-frame shot of the presenter seated at her desk, gesturing, with a wall-mounted screen behind her.

00:02:38.443 --> 00:02:41.443
An arrow and a "Step 2" column appear, showing an icon of three stacked video player thumbnails with play buttons.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.580
A new slide shows a TikTok "Choose your interests" screen with selectable topic tags like Gaming, Science & Education, Art, and Life Hacks highlighted.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:14.150
A TikTok settings menu screenshot replaces the interests screen, with "Language" outlined in green among Push Notifications, Digital Wellbeing, and Accessibility options.

00:03:24.298 --> 00:03:27.298
The slide is replaced by a full-frame shot of the speaker in a black T-shirt gesturing while talking, with ring lights and a wall-mounted screen behind her.

00:03:48.878 --> 00:03:51.878
Recap slide: "3 ways TikTok determines a user's interests," item 1 selected interests at signup

00:03:58.744 --> 00:04:01.744
A hand-drawn oval annotation circles the third bullet, "The users interactions (and non-actions) with the app."

00:04:34.315 --> 00:04:37.315
Cut from the slide to the presenter on camera, seated in a studio with a wall-mounted screen displaying a grid of photos behind her.

00:04:46.741 --> 00:04:49.741
Two TikTok profile screenshots appear flanking the presenter: one personal-brand account with 5,599 followers and another with 40.1K followers, each showing video grids.

00:05:02.027 --> 00:05:05.027
Slide: "The 'FYP' Explained — Step 1: study user interests"

00:05:11.471 --> 00:05:14.471
A phone mockup appears showing a TikTok video of a child stretching in a living room, with full app interface and caption overlay.

00:05:30.959 --> 00:05:33.959
Cut from the slide to the presenter on camera in a black top, holding up an open hand while speaking, with a bright office and monitor behind her.

00:05:45.087 --> 00:05:48.087
Camera cuts to a closer shot of the presenter, now framed from the chest up, gesturing with both hands raised as she speaks.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:03.650
Camera pulls back to a wider shot; the presenter lowers her hands to her sides, with the monitor and desk items more visible behind her.

00:06:10.251 --> 00:06:13.251
Camera pushes in to a tighter shot; the presenter smiles and raises both hands in front of her chest while speaking.

00:06:30.132 --> 00:06:33.132
Camera pulls back to a wider shot; the presenter lowers her hands out of frame, revealing more of the monitor and desk behind her.

00:07:29.481 --> 00:07:32.481
Camera pushes in to a tighter shot; the presenter raises both hands in front of her chest, fingers spread, while speaking.

00:07:47.394 --> 00:07:50.394
A phone mockup appears showing a TikTok search results page with a "Search Highlights" text box and grid of food/recipe video thumbnails.

00:07:56.076 --> 00:07:59.076
Bullet: match to search inquiry via video captions, video text, hashtags

00:08:34.875 --> 00:08:37.875
Cut from the slide to a woman speaking on camera in a room with a wall-mounted screen displaying a photo collage.

00:08:47.686 --> 00:08:50.686
Search sorting factors list; user info: device settings, language, location

00:09:01.794 --> 00:09:04.794
"is generally weighted more heavily than others" highlighted

00:09:23.182 --> 00:09:26.182
Cut from text slide to woman speaking to camera in a white room with a TV displaying a photo grid behind her.

00:09:57.607 --> 00:10:00.607
Shot widens to a fuller view, showing the white desk and more of the room as she lowers both hands to the desktop.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.950
Camera pushes in to a tighter framing as she raises both hands, fingers spread, gesturing near her face while speaking.

00:10:28.903 --> 00:10:31.903
Cut from the dark text slide back to the speaker seated at her white desk, gesturing with one hand as she talks to camera.

00:10:50.528 --> 00:10:53.528
Slide appears with a phone screenshot of TikTok search results for "low light houseplants," showing thumbnail grid of plant videos alongside the numbered tips.

00:10:59.451 --> 00:11:02.451
Phone mockup swaps to a TikTok video of a plant shop interior, overlaid with "Plant Tok" and "Low light plants" text.

00:11:18.462 --> 00:11:21.462
Cut to the presenter speaking on camera at a white desk, gesturing with both hands, a TV showing a photo grid behind her.

00:12:15.285 --> 00:12:18.285
Camera pulls back to a wider shot of the presenter at the desk, revealing more of the room, lamps and decor.

00:12:46.536 --> 00:12:49.536
Camera pushes in to a tighter shot of the presenter, who raises both hands in front of her chest while speaking.

00:13:11.252 --> 00:13:14.252
Camera pulls back to a wider shot of the presenter, who lowers both hands from her chest and clasps them in front of her.

00:13:35.388 --> 00:13:38.388
Camera pushes in to a closer shot of the presenter, who moves both hands outward in front of her chest while speaking.

00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:37.333
Presenter raises both hands and holds up two fingers on each hand while speaking to camera.

00:14:47.884 --> 00:14:50.884
Presenter lowers her left hand and raises her right hand with fingers spread, gesturing while continuing to speak to camera.

00:15:03.257 --> 00:15:06.257
Presenter brings both hands up in front of her chest with thumbs raised, mouth open mid-speech, facing the camera directly.

